## 📁 Folder Selection Details

**Supported Formats:**
- Standard: JPG, JPEG, PNG, BMP, GIF, WEBP
- RAW: CR2, NEF, ARW, DNG (via LibRaw)

**How It Works:**
1. Click folder button
2. Select directory
3. Model scans for supported files
4. Clears synthetic data
5. Loads real image paths
6. AsyncImageProvider decodes on-demand
7. Viewport culling limits to visible range

