## 📊 Expected Results

### With Optimizations (Culling + Budget)
- **Smooth scrolling** at 50-60 FPS
- **Queue depth** stays under 50
- **Memory** grows linearly with visible items
- **No UI freezes** even with 10,000+ items

### Without Optimizations
- **Choppy scrolling** at 10-20 FPS
- **Queue depth** spikes to 200+
- **Memory** loads all items immediately
- **UI freezes** during rapid scrolling

